13	/**
14	 * First step of {@code POST /api/owners}. Rejects a request that is missing or blank in any
15	 * required owner field before {@link BuildOwner} runs, throwing {@link MissingFieldsException}
16	 * (handled as a 400 listing the offending field names). Normalizes the address (see
17	 * {@link OwnerAddress}) before that check, so an address left blank once whitespace is collapsed is
18	 * rejected as missing. Normalizes the telephone to E.164 form (see {@link OwnerTelephone}), throwing
19	 * {@link InvalidTelephoneException} (400) when it cannot form a valid number. Publishes the
20	 * normalized body for later steps, so the stored, returned and compared address is the normalized
21	 * form.
